    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so selfish to keep taking from him when i have nothing left to give back. it's like i'm holding him hostage to my illness. if i were gone, he could actually start a new life, maybe find someone who isn't a constant responsibility. wouldn't it be more loving to just let him go instead of making him watch me slowly fall apart?",
